ty tensor-network ansatz on chi_P admits polylog bond dim — generalises the Lagarias-Odlyzko sqrt(x) barrier from MPS to all listed ansätze. Cites E2.1 (annotated S77), E1.9, E6.3. See experiments/constructions/tensor_compression_family_closure/. | 77 |
