Beautiful. At d=20:
- k=1,2: conductor 6 → 2 vectors = φ(3) ✓ (mod-3 sector)
- k=3-6: conductor 10 → 4 = φ(5) ✓ (mod-5)
- k=7-12: conductor 14 → 6 = φ(7) ✓ (mod-7)
- k=13-20: conductor 30 → 8 = φ(15) ✓ (cross 3·5)
- k=21-25: conductor 88 ≈ mod-11

